---
import Doc from '../layouts/Doc.astro';
import SiteLink from '../components/SiteLink.astro';
import { APP_NAME, BUSINESS_NAME, SUPPORT_EMAIL } from '../utils/env';

const effectiveDateISO = '2026-04-23';
const effectiveDateLabel = 'April 23, 2026';
---

<Doc
  title="Privacy"
  description={`How ${APP_NAME} handles data. Optional anonymous analytics via TelemetryDeck, no game-content server.`}
>
  <header class="doc__header">
    <h1>Privacy</h1>
  </header>

  <p>
    {APP_NAME} has no server. We do not receive your drawings, guesses,
    contacts, message contents, or payment information.
  </p>

  <section>
    <h2>Analytics</h2>
    <p>
      Analytics are off by default. If you turn them on in the app's
      Settings screen, TelemetryDeck receives:
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>An anonymized installation ID.</li>
      <li>Event names, such as app launches, pack picks, restore results, and save actions.</li>
      <li>Rounded timestamps.</li>
      <li>App and device metadata, such as app version, build, OS version, and device type.</li>
      <li>Limited event metadata, such as pack IDs, counts, and timing values.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      TelemetryDeck does not receive stored IP addresses, cookies, or
      cross-app tracking data.
    </p>
    <p>
      We use analytics to understand feature usage, diagnose failures,
      and improve the app. We do not use them for advertising,
      profiling, or sale. We process them on the basis of your consent,
      which you can withdraw at any time in the app's Settings screen.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Third parties</h2>
    <p>
      TelemetryDeck GmbH processes the anonymous analytics described
      above. Their privacy policy is at <SiteLink
        href="https://telemetrydeck.com/privacy"
        target="_blank"
        aria-label="TelemetryDeck privacy policy, opens in new tab"
      >telemetrydeck.com/privacy</SiteLink>&#8288;.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Retention</h2>
    <p>Anonymous analytics are retained by TelemetryDeck under their own policy.</p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Do Not Track</h2>
    <p>This app does not track your online activities across third-party websites or services.</p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Children's privacy</h2>
    <p>
      So Sketchy is not directed to children under 13 and does not
      knowingly collect personal information from them.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Who we are</h2>
    <p>
      So Sketchy is published by {BUSINESS_NAME}. Email <SiteLink
        href={`mailto:${SUPPORT_EMAIL}`}
      >{SUPPORT_EMAIL}</SiteLink>&#8288; with privacy questions or to
      request access to or deletion of personal information we hold
      about you.
    </p>
  </section>

  <footer class="doc__meta">Effective <time datetime={effectiveDateISO}>{effectiveDateLabel}</time></footer>
</Doc>
